  "description": "Organization (tenant / workspace) services for Zonit applications. Provides IWorkspaceProvider (the active organization as a read-only Organization value object), IWorkspaceManager (per-scope workspace state and organization switching) and IOrganizationSource, the contract your app implements to supply the data. Framework-agnostic: no HttpContext and no middleware here - the ASP.NET Core middleware that hydrates the scope ships in Zonit.Extensions.Website. Built on top of Zonit.Extensions value objects (Organization).",
